            "line": 231,
            "text": "theorem pointwise_count (A : ℝ) :\n    ∃ C > 0, ∀ D q : ℝ, ∀ x : Position,\n      (pointwiseLabels D A q x).Finite ∧\n        ((pointwiseLabels D A q x).ncard : ℝ) ≤ C"
